  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetsmilj&#xf6;insats, riskb.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Risk assessm. Labour insp</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Seminarier d&#xe4;r yrkesinspekt&#xf6;rer utbildas i hur man identifierar riskeri arbetsmilj&#xf6;n genom att anv&#xe4;nda olika metoder f&#xf6;r riskanalys. Huvudsyftet &#xe4;r att introducera riskidentifieringsmetoder f&#xf6;r analys av existerande och framtida arbetsmilj&#xf6;risker i Estland.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the project is to introduce risk assessment methods for the analysis of existing and future working environment risks in Estonia. A training programme for Estonian Labour Inspectors is being conducted, consisting of 3 seminars, whereof Sida finances one.</narrative>
  </description>
